xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            日本三名園「水戸 偕楽園（かいらくえん）」の梅まつりとは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 金沢兼六園・岡山後楽園と並ぶ名園で、毎年2月中旬〜3月下旬に約100種3000本の梅が咲き誇り、好文亭や千波湖の眺望が素晴らしい春の祭典です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            日本三名瀑「袋田の滝（ふくろだのたき）」の見どころは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 那智の滝・華厳の滝と並ぶ名瀑で、高さ120m・幅73mの岸壁を四段に落下する壮大な姿や、冬に完全凍結する『氷瀑（ひょうばく）』が有名です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            奥久慈名物「奥久慈しゃも（おくくじしゃも）」の美味しさは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 豊かな自然の中で平飼いされた地鶏で、脂肪分が少なく引き締まった歯ごたえと濃厚なコクが特徴で、しゃも鍋や焼き鳥、親子丼が絶品です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！茨城県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 茨城県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/ibaraki-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】茨城おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">茨城県全域（大洗ひたちなか海浜公園・筑波山つくば土浦・水戸偕楽園袋田の滝・北茨城五浦海岸鹿島）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kitaibaraki-izura-coast-kashima-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】北茨城・五浦海岸・鹿島おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">北茨城市・高萩市・日立市・鹿嶋市・潮来市（五浦海岸・磯原温泉・太田尻海岸・鹿島神宮・水郷潮来）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/oarai-hitachinaka-seaside-park-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】大洗・ひたちなかおすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">東茨城郡大洗町・ひたちなか市（大洗海岸・大洗港・阿字ヶ浦・勝田駅前・国営ひたち海浜公園）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tsukuba-mountain-tsukuba-city-tsuchiura-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】筑波山・つくばおすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">つくば市・土浦市（筑波山山麓・筑波山神社・つくば駅前・研究学園・土浦駅直結・霞ヶ浦）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/fukushima-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【福島県】【2026年最新】福島おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">福島県全域（会津若松・東山芦ノ牧・猪苗代裏磐梯・いわきハワイアンズ・高湯飯坂）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tochigi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【栃木県】【2026年最新】栃木おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">栃木県全域（世界遺産日光・中禅寺湖・鬼怒川温泉・那須高原・宇都宮）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/saitama-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【埼玉県】【2026年最新】埼玉おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">埼玉県全域（秩父長瀞三峯神社・小江戸川越・大宮さいたま新都心浦和・飯能名栗温泉熊谷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chiba-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【千葉県】【2026年最新】千葉おすすめホテル・温泉リゾート10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">千葉県全域（舞浜浦安TDR・南房総館山鴨川・銚子九十九里・木更津鋸山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}